inivan for big groups, traveling with skis or bicycles, or trips to the airport.\n\n• SCOOTERS\nBright yellow Yandex Go scooters are already cruising cities. Rent up to three scooters from the same account, buy Minute Bundles to make rides more affordable, and use Yandex Plus to subscribe to Scooters for free unlocks.\n\n• FOOD FROM RESTAURANTS\nOrder delivery from independent and popular chain restaurants. Stock up on snacks for a party, soup, khachapuri, wok, sushi, pizza, and vegan options.\n\n• MARKET YANDEX GO\nMarket Yandex Go offers dozens of categories and millions of important, useful items in Russia and Uzbekistan. Enjoy the user-friendly search or select the categories to find what you're looking for. Add items to your cart, place and track your order — all in the Yandex Go app.\nIf you've already added items to your Yandex Market cart, you'll see your order in Yandex Go and can continue checkout there. If an item is out of stock, we'll suggest alternatives at about the same price.\n\n• DELIVERY\nHave a courier pick up your printer after repairs, hand over documents to a contractor, or haul off that old couch you sold. For large items, you can order a cargo truck. Couriers will arrive for pickup in just 15 minutes.\n\n• TRANSPORT\nView schedules for buses, trams, commuter trains, and other public transport, compare routes, and find the nearest stops and convenient transfers. Available in some cities for now.\n \nAvailability of services and options may vary depending on the region.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.8992, "sellerUrl": "https://go.yandex/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["AM", "AR", "HY", "BE", "KM", "EN", "ET", "FI", "FR", "KA", "HE", "KK", "KY", "LV", "LT", "NE", "NB", "PT", "RO", "RU", "SR", "ZH", "ES", "SW", "TG", "ZH", "TR", "UK", "UR", "UZ"], "fileSizeBytes": "542552064", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 10774, "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 10774}]}